    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A precision platformer where you maneuver your unicycle though dozens of levels and side modes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you become one with the Unicycleverse?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features very simple controls that are hard to master: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lean left, lean right and jump, very simple. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But these controls allow you to do many things in different contexts. On the ground; alternate leaning left and right to peddle; allowing to move. In the air; lean left or right to flip left or right, paired with a jump; this effectively doubles your jump height! You can also wall jump!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A precision platformer where you maneuver your unicycle though dozens of levels and side modes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you become one with the Unicycleverse?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features very simple controls that are hard to master: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lean left, lean right and jump, very simple. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But these controls allow you to do many things in different contexts. On the ground; alternate leaning left and right to peddle; allowing to move. In the air; lean left or right to flip left or right, paired with a jump; this effectively doubles your jump height! You can also wall jump!</p>",
    "short_description": "A precision platformer where you maneuver and weave your unicycle through hundreds of dastardly obstacles across dozens of levels and side modes. Upon mastering the controls; the game becomes a meditative experience and you will discover what it means to be \u2018One with the Unicycleverse.\u2019",
